  "challenge": "This is decidable as REJECT without a human in the loop. get_vendor_invoice_history shows MegaWidgets Corp has zero prior invoices despite an active relationship since 2021, so there is no acceptance pattern to lean on; AR-004’s $110 total gap is an integrity failure on the face of the document (14750+885=15635 ≠ 15525); and IN-003 plus get_item_reference confirm unfulfillable demand (WidgetA 20>15, WidgetB 15>10). PO-001’s manager-threshold gate only matters if the invoice is headed for payment—when arithmetic and stock already fail, AP can reject and request a corrected, fulfillable resubmit rather than escalate three issues that the packet already resolves.",
